# Testing

- Run the narrowest meaningful test first (`go test ./internal/memory/...` before full suite).
- Broaden scope when touching shared contracts (store, service, API router).
- Add tests only where risk justifies it; do not test the obvious.
- If tests cannot run, say why (e.g. embedded Postgres, sandbox shm).

## Brainy eval layers
- Unit: `go test ./...`
- Parity: `python3 evals/run_eval.py` against running API
- Vertical (marketing): `fixtures/vertical/marketing/` when ENG-82 lands
- Postgres integration tests need full permissions outside sandbox.
